  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Clowner utan gr&#xE4;nser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clowns without borders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">15 circus trainers, recruited from local youth (ages 15-25), will be educated in circus techniques, pedagogy, play-therapy, networking and administration and will run their own circus groups for about 600 children in the ages 6-16. The children will play, train and perform in their local Palestinian refugee camps and gatherings. An estimate of 40.000 people is expected to be reached with circus performances.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till palestinska flyktingar i Libanon. 15 cirkus tr&#xE4;nare rekryterade fr&#xE5;n lokala ungdomar utbildas i cirkustekning, pedagogik, lek-terapi, n&#xE4;tverkande och administration. Cirkus tr&#xE4;narna kommer i sin tur att leda egna cirkusgrupper f&#xF6;r ca 600 barn. Barnen v&#xE4;ntas leka, tr&#xE4;nas att g&#xF6;ra framtr&#xE4;danden i sina flyktingl&#xE4;ger. Ungef&#xE4;r 40 000 personer v&#xE4;ntas n&#xE5;s genom cirkusfr&#xE4;mtradanden.</narrative>
  </description>
